scripts
# Phase 8C: the API image needs the font verifier scripts to enforce the
# required-font policy at boot. Exclude everything else under scripts/.
!scripts/fonts/**
# The explicit, profile-gated fresh-DB bootstrap job runs this one audited
# generator inside the API image.
!scripts/audit/
!scripts/audit/build-phase-8c-bootstrap-sql.mjs
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.mjs

# The production runtime needs only governed locked and compiled contracts.
docs/**
!docs/audit/
!docs/audit/docx/
!docs/audit/docx/contracts/
!docs/audit/docx/contracts/locked/
!docs/audit/docx/contracts/locked/**
!docs/audit/docx/compiled-v2/
!docs/audit/docx/compiled-v2/**
